          "text": "SHÊN Fu 沈復 (T. 三白, H. 梅逸), Dec. 26, 1763–?, writer and painter, was a native of Yuanho (Soochow), Kiangsu. His father was by profession a secretary to magistrates, his duties relating primarily to judicial and financial matters.",
